$cats['Japanese']['Japanese Dragons'] = @('A dragon head turns sharply back toward its own body as though something behind it has caught its attention. The neck makes one compact coil beneath the head while two cloud forms create depth without overwhelming the piece','A dragon climbs vertically up the forearm with its head near the elbow and body making two strong turns toward the wrist. Portions disappear behind compact clouds so the entire animal does not need to be shown','A dragon emerges downward from clouds with its face approaching the viewer and claws extending forward. Foreshortening makes the head dramatically larger than the disappearing body','A dragon curves around the calf with the head visible from the front while most of the body disappears around the leg. The wearer physically turns to reveal the complete composition','A dragons head rests within a compact spiral of dark cloud. The expression is watchful rather than aggressive and the composition concentrates on beautiful facial structure horns whiskers and controlled movement','A dragon rises from turbulent water rather than flying through clouds. The body emerges vertically from the water with spray breaking across its lower coils','A dragon travels diagonally across the ribs with its long body creating the principal movement. Only sparse cloud forms accompany it leaving substantial skin between the coils','A dragon coils around the shoulder cap with its head moving onto the upper chest and its body disappearing toward the shoulder blade','Two dragons move around one another through opposing cloud currents without fighting. Their bodies create a circular composition centered on an intentional opening of untouched skin','A massive dragon descends across the back through a developing storm. The head dominates one shoulder blade while the body coils through clouds and disappears behind the opposite side before reappearing lower on the back')
$cats['Japanese']['Japanese Koi and Water'] = @('A single koi turns sharply upward through one curling wave. The body bends dramatically enough that the fish and water create one compact circular movement','A koi climbs vertically against a powerful downward current. Water direction makes the struggle immediately understandable without requiring additional symbols','A gold koi turns beneath the surface so its head is large and clear while the tail disappears beneath overlapping water','Two koi move in opposite directions around a central pocket of untouched skin. Water connects them without turning the composition into a rigid symbol','A dark koi bursts through the surface with its head emerging between white foam shapes while most of the body remains submerged','A koi swims quietly beneath several floating maple leaves. Instead of violent water gentle current lines create a calmer interpretation of the subject','A koi turns almost directly toward the viewer creating unusual foreshortening through the head and pectoral fins while the tail recedes behind it','Three koi travel upward around the leg at different depths. One is dominant while the others partially disappear behind currents and foam','A koi rises from turbulent water into calmer water as the composition travels upward across the body creating a visual transition from chaos into control','A powerful koi composition travels from lower leg toward thigh with water changing character throughout the piece from heavy turbulence below to increasingly open movement above')
$cats['Japanese']['Japanese Tigers and Powerful Animals'] = @('A tiger descends diagonally through wind-bent bamboo with one front paw reaching downward. The body is stretched through motion rather than compressed into a conventional tiger pose','A tiger turns its head over one shoulder while continuing forward creating tension without roaring or attacking','A tiger moves around the calf with the head visible from one angle and the striped torso wrapping naturally around the leg','A tiger crouches low beneath wind-driven bamboo. Large areas of the animal remain hidden by vegetation so the eye reconstructs the complete body','A tiger leaps downward from a rock ledge with its front paws extending toward the viewer and the rear body receding dramatically upward','A fox stands quietly beneath a branch of red maple leaves using negative skin and sparse environmental elements instead of filling every available area','A hawk drops through wind with wings partially folded and talons extended. The diagonal movement makes the bird feel genuinely airborne rather than displayed','A crane steps through shallow water while one enormous wing opens behind it. The water remains restrained so the birds silhouette carries the composition','A tiger emerges through a storm of bamboo and wind across the shoulder and chest with the head appearing first and the body progressively revealing itself around the anatomy','A huge tiger descends across the back through rocks pine and wind. The landscape exists to establish the animals movement rather than functioning as decorative background')
$cats['Japanese']['Japanese Snakes and Serpent Movement'] = @('A snake makes one elegant loop around a chrysanthemum with enough open skin that both subjects remain individually powerful','A snake travels vertically up the calf in three broad curves with its head turning outward near the knee','A dark snake passes behind a pale peony and reappears through different openings between the petals creating real foreground and background depth','A snake descends from the shoulder with its head pointed downward and body disappearing briefly around the back of the arm before returning near the elbow','A snake moves through wind-blown maple leaves with no flowers or additional centerpiece. The repeated curves of animal and leaves create the entire composition','A serpent rises from water with droplets and foam breaking across its body while the upper coils remain completely clear','A snake passes diagonally across the ribs with only one chrysanthemum positioned where the body makes its strongest turn','A serpent moves from upper chest over the shoulder and onto the back allowing different portions of the animal to become visible from different viewpoints','Two snakes travel through opposing currents of wind and cloud across the thigh without forming a rigid symmetrical arrangement','A monumental serpent winds across the torso and back passing behind rocks through cloud and beneath selected botanical forms. No single viewpoint reveals the entire animal')
$cats['Japanese']['Japanese Masks Faces and Human Emotion'] = @('A Hannya mask is shown at a three-quarter angle rather than straight on. One horn moves toward the viewer while the opposite side disappears into a single dark curl of atmosphere','A compact Hannya composition concentrates entirely on the face with no surrounding flowers giving the expression and sculptural structure room to dominate','A female face looks downward while a Noh mask hangs beside her rather than covering her face creating a relationship between living expression and performed identity','A samurai portrait is shown after removing the helmet. Wind moves loose hair across the face while several maple leaves establish direction and season','A womans face is partially hidden behind an opened folding fan. The fan creates a strong geometric foreground while her eyes remain the focal point','A warrior looks sideways beneath the edge of a helmet while rain crosses the composition diagonally. The expression is quiet concentration rather than aggression','A woman turns into strong wind with hair and kimono fabric moving in opposite directions around her face','A warrior kneels beside his helmet at the edge of water. The quiet pose and reflected shapes beneath him create more emotion than a battle scene','A female figure moves through falling cherry blossoms while the fabric of her clothing establishes one long sweeping direction through the composition','A warrior stands knee-deep in turbulent water after battle helmet hanging from one hand while wind drives maple leaves across the scene. The entire composition emphasizes aftermath rather than combat')
$cats['Japanese']['Japanese Flowers and Seasons'] = @('A single peony opens across the shoulder with petals arranged to reinforce the rounded anatomy. Dark leaves appear only where needed to create depth','A chrysanthemum is viewed from an unusual low angle so the petals radiate dramatically upward rather than presenting the flower as a flat circle','A peony bends beneath strong wind with several petals separating from the bloom and traveling through the composition','A chrysanthemum wraps around the elbow with its center deliberately offset so the petals travel naturally across the joint rather than forming a target','A branch of cherry blossoms crosses the collarbone asymmetrically with only a few fully opened flowers and substantial untouched skin','Red maple leaves tumble vertically through wind with no central animal or figure. Scale changes and overlapping create the depth','A large peony and chrysanthemum overlap across the thigh but each flower faces a different direction so the composition feels like living growth rather than a bouquet','Pine branches move diagonally across the shoulder with strong wind bars and substantial open skin creating a Japanese composition without a conventional hero subject','Cherry blossoms travel from hip toward ribs as if carried upward by wind becoming progressively smaller and more dispersed as they rise','Four seasonal transitions move subtly through a larger botanical composition without turning into four separate panels. Changes in foliage flower and atmospheric movement communicate time passing')
$cats['Japanese']['Japanese Water Wind and The Natural World'] = @('One enormous Japanese wave rises vertically with no animal or human subject. Black water structure blue-grey fields foam and open skin make the water itself the hero','Two opposing waves collide around the forearm creating a circular opening of bare skin at the moment before impact','Wind bends tall grasses almost horizontally while a small crescent moon sits quietly in the open area above them','A waterfall drops vertically through dark rocks with the white water largely created from untouched skin and controlled linework','Storm clouds roll around the shoulder while lightning appears only once as a sharp opening through the dark environment','A rocky coastline meets violent water diagonally across the thigh. The composition uses traditional Japanese water mechanics without requiring a creature','Wind-driven rain crosses a sparse bamboo grove with several leaves tearing loose into open skin','Waves travel around the lower leg so foam appears and disappears as the body rotates turning the leg itself into the coastline','Clouds rise from hip toward ribs and gradually open into clear skin creating the sensation of moving upward through a storm','An entire back becomes a storm environment of water cloud wind and distant rock with no conventional central creature. Movement through the natural forces becomes the artwork')
